title: Global shell › Addresses › Old links, redirects and pages that do not exist
route: /  /manager  /active  /referrals  /referrals/:id  and any unknown address
intro: A few old or short addresses are sent on to the page that replaced them (Case Manager's /manager and /active now open a view of Authorizations), and anything the demo does not know opens a 'Page not found' screen inside the normal sidebar and top bar. Redirects replace the address, so the Back button skips over the old one.
dir: LR
also: In the single-file build the address lives after a '#'. The hosted preview has no address bar, so it keeps the route in memory and the same rules apply.
---
start s1 "An address is opened\n(typed, a saved link, or a click)"
process p0 "The app matches the address against its list of pages"
decision d1 "Which address is it?"

group gRed "Redirects (the old address is replaced)"
  process r1 "'/' goes to /dashboard"
  goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard"
  process r2 "'/manager' and '/active' (old Case Manager links) go to /authorizations\nThe view is always named, so an old link never lands on the last view used"
  decision dm "What does the old link carry?"
  process m1 "?tab=reviews, or a ?review=\ngoes to /authorizations?view=reviews\nA ?review= is kept and opens that review's drawer"
  process m2 "Anything else (nothing, ?tab=cases, ...)\ngoes to /authorizations?view=all"
  process m3 "?show=active or ?show=renewal (the Dashboard's Active and Renewal due chips) is kept; any other ?show= is dropped\nFor example /active?show=renewal becomes /authorizations?view=all&show=renewal"
  process m4 "'/authorizations?tab=reviews' (Case Manager's parameter on the new address) opens Reviews this week too\nThe address is rewritten in place to /authorizations?view=reviews"
  goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › Addresses and old queue links"
  process r3 "'/referrals' goes to /authorizations/new\nReferrals no longer have a tab: they start Intake in New Case"
  process r3b "New Case starts a blank draft and the address becomes /authorizations/new/draft-..."
  goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"
  process r4 "'/referrals/RF-1234' goes to /authorizations/new/referral/RF-1234"
  goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The full referral page"
endgroup

group gKnown "Pages that exist"
  process k1 "/dashboard, /authorizations..., /denials..., /analytics, /emr, /payers..., /settings\nThe page opens and starts at the top"
  goto g5 "Continues in: Global shell › Sidebar › Where every item goes"
endgroup

group gNo "Anything else"
  screen n1 "Page not found\n'That address is not part of the demo.'\nEmpty card: 'Nothing here'\n'Use the sidebar to get back on track.'"
  process n2 "Sidebar and top bar stay as normal. No sidebar row is green. There is no button on the card"
  click n3 "Click any row in the sidebar"
  goto g6 "Continues in: Global shell › Sidebar › Where every item goes"
  click n4 "Click the browser Back button"
  end n5 "Back on the page before the bad address"
endgroup

group gOwn "Known page, unknown record (the page answers)"
  process o1 "/authorizations/case/XYZ shows 'Request not found' with 'Back to Authorizations'"
  process o2 "/authorizations/new/XYZ shows 'We could not find that draft' with 'Start a new case'"
  goto g7 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › How a case starts and resumes"
endgroup

s1 --> p0 --> d1
d1 -->|/| r1 --> g1
d1 -->|/manager or /active| r2 --> dm
dm -->|Reviews| m1
dm -->|Anything else| m2
m1 & m2 --> m3 --> g2
d1 -->|/authorizations?tab=reviews| m4 --> g2
d1 -->|/referrals| r3 --> r3b --> g3
d1 -->|/referrals/id| r4 --> g4
d1 -->|A page above| k1 --> g5
d1 -->|Anything else| n1 --> n2
n2 --> n3 --> g6
n2 --> n4 --> n5
d1 -->|Page exists, record does not| o1
o1 --> g7
o2 --> g7
d1 -.-> o2
